    "order": 0,
    "width": 12,
    "height": 3,
    "content": "## Weather forecast\n\nCurrent air temperature and wind speed are refreshed with the forecast. The rainfall chart shows the latest five-day forecast from Open-Meteo.",
    "className": "",
    "x": 300,
